#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""The World Today - Tuesday 24 November 2026 in one image.

A program that draws a one-page newspaper front page summing up the
world's news of Tuesday 24 November 2026 and writes it to
/output/entry.png (1024x1024 PNG, deterministic: identical bytes on
every run).

Pure Python standard library only; no network; no reading of files
outside this program. The text is drawn from glyph coverage bitmaps
embedded below (rasterised at build time from the DejaVu fonts that
ship with most Linux systems); every illustration is drawn in code.
"""
